<title>Israel, Gaza and the West Bank: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/gaza/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-gaza-2026-11-22T00:32:07.809Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 00:32:07 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli forces have expanded ground operations in central Gaza, crossing the Yellow Line and conducting airstrikes such as the one on Nasser Hospital that killed six Palestinians. In the West Bank, Israeli settlers shot a 72‑year-old Palestinian woman near a new outpost and the IDF demolished a Palestinian home in violation of a Supreme Court order, while Israel delayed settlement building contracts after UK sanctions. Israeli strikes on vehicles distributing food aid in Gaza have repeatedly killed three people, with the IDF saying the targets were terror operatives masquerading as aid workers. The conflict has caused 21,440 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/19/world/europe/myanmar-genocide-icj-decision-.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168849&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/18/israel-construction-contracts-e1-west-bank-settlement-uk-sanctions&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxOUVlUcjlPZURmRnhmY2JJZVVBTkhfUEM2bmhqRDZfQkZJMTBEc2hQSDdRVFQ0N1BjTW1rMXNrSnM4R0R6SVcyZXJpWEVVU3hkU0dsX0otVk1HNV9abFFBTkVUeXMtdHk2WVFUcEVFOVVUVlZUeTFUdXBuVzVHMVFmeFdFVExwTWtJVC1sd0dEVDVSdXdHZUhVRDc4MU5rYU1laFBn?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxPNER6Q2NPRk9TUmtuX1hhQ21MdEdsc05rT0FxZzE4RTczVDJqbjN1My04Zm4tUkd1aUJ